# MMB Loader Specification

## Role
role: Reality Ingestion Layer
responsibility:
  - load
  - parse
  - normalize
  - project

## Data Types
types:
  tier_1_structured:
    - csv
    - xlsx
    - json
    - yaml
    - parquet
  tier_2_semi:
    - html
    - markdown
    - pdf
    - docx
  tier_3_image:
    - jpg
    - png
    - webp
  tier_4_audio:
    - wav
    - mp3
    - flac
  tier_5_video:
    - mp4
    - mkv
  tier_6_sensor:
    - lidar
    - radar
    - gps

## Execution Flow
flow:
  - detect_format
  - route_provider
  - normalize
  - project_tensor
  - RACIN_arena

---